# fixtures/corpus-manifest.toml is generated by `cargo xtask
# gen-corpus-manifest` (US-RR-11-6), checked byte for byte, and its hash is
# the CI corpus cache key (US-RR-11-8): git must keep its `\n` line endings
# on every checkout (core.autocrlf=true would otherwise make them `\r\n`).
/corpus-manifest.toml text eol=lf
# fixtures/corpus-coverage.toml is generated by `cargo xtask
# gen-corpus-coverage` (US-RR-16-6) and checked byte for byte in CI.
/corpus-coverage.toml text eol=lf
